                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The project investigates the characteristics and backgrounds of crime within relations, its prevalence, type of perpetrators and characteristics of victims. Effects of various types of interventions and sanctions are explored. Studying which types of crime within relations are discovered by the police, its backgrounds and characteristics, interventions and sanctions.</p>"
                }
              },
